  "file_name": "30ae6e2a-4.pdf",
  "pages": [
    {
      "page_index": 2,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "id": "qNfEYrA8tY",
          "order": null,
          "bounding_box": {
            "x": 0.11323641928079571,
            "y": 0.09101654846335698,
            "width": 0.6457536342769702,
            "height": 0.041371158392434985
          },
          "block_content": "where $F$ is a continuous cumulative distribution function. For any candidate value $x\\in\\mathbb{R}$ for $\\tau$, define the empirical\ndistribution function",
          "label": "Text"
        },
        {
          "id": "438sTg2lzz",
          "order": null,
          "bounding_box": {
            "x": 0.11629686304514154,
            "y": 0.18557919621749408,
            "width": 0.3098699311400153,
            "height": 0.016548463356973995
          },
          "block_content": "Assume that, under the null hypothesis",
          "label": "Text"
        },
        {
          "id": "tfqkquJXEV",
          "order": null,
          "bounding_box": {
            "x": 0.117061973986228,
            "y": 0.27423167848699764,
            "width": 0.33741392501912776,
            "height": 0.01773049645390071
          },
          "block_content": "Consider the test that rejects $H_0$ whenever",
          "label": "Text"
        },
        {
          "id": "mcn18rBt4C",
          "order": null,
          "bounding_box": {
            "x": 0.12012241775057383,
            "y": 0.32328605200945626,
            "width": 0.4483550114766641,
            "height": 0.016548463356973995
          },
          "block_content": "Suppose \\eqref{1}-\\eqref{2} hold. Under $H_0:\\tau=x$,",
          "label": "Text"
        },
        {
          "id": "XMj61tly6A",
          "order": null,
          "bounding_box": {
            "x": 0.11017597551644988,
            "y": 0.375886524822695,
            "width": 0.3006885998469778,
            "height": 0.02009456264775414
          },
          "block_content": "Thus, the test is asymptotically exact.",
          "label": "Text"
        },
        {
          "id": "V8GqdkxmhH",
          "order": null,
          "bounding_box": {
            "x": 0.11400153022188217,
            "y": 0.4013002364066194,
            "width": 0.1423106350420811,
            "height": 0.016548463356973995
          },
          "block_content": "Proof. Under H 0 ,",
          "label": "Text"
        },
        {
          "id": "cSFmcBIOYo",
          "order": null,
          "bounding_box": {
            "x": 0.117061973986228,
            "y": 0.4385342789598109,
            "width": 0.030604437643458302,
            "height": 0.016548463356973995
          },
          "block_content": "Let",
          "label": "Text"
        },
        {
          "id": "VO9kYGn41I",
          "order": null,
          "bounding_box": {
            "x": 0.11782708492731446,
            "y": 0.47754137115839246,
            "width": 0.6059678653404744,
            "height": 0.018321513002364065
          },
          "block_content": "Then V has cumulative distribution function F . Uniform consistency implies",
          "label": "Text"
        },
        {
          "id": "dAc-KUkRY3",
          "order": null,
          "bounding_box": {
            "x": 0.11859219586840092,
            "y": 0.5390070921985816,
            "width": 0.05202754399387911,
            "height": 0.013593380614657211
          },
          "block_content": "Hence,",
          "label": "Text"
        },
        {
          "id": "ahe5WEVbVC",
          "order": null,
          "bounding_box": {
            "x": 0.14690130068859986,
            "y": 0.5738770685579196,
            "width": 0.5034429992348891,
            "height": 0.02009456264775414
          },
          "block_content": "Since F is continuous, the probability integral transform implies",
          "label": "Text"
        },
        {
          "id": "tdZTdkQ8S6",
          "order": null,
          "bounding_box": {
            "x": 0.11782708492731446,
            "y": 0.6229314420803782,
            "width": 0.07957153787299158,
            "height": 0.016548463356973995
          },
          "block_content": "Therefore,",
          "label": "Text"
        },
        {
          "id": "Y8fJHEJaGp",
          "order": null,
          "bounding_box": {
            "x": 0.11476664116296863,
            "y": 0.6690307328605201,
            "width": 0.03289977046671767,
            "height": 0.01004728132387707
          },
          "block_content": "and",
          "label": "Text"
        },
        {
          "id": "zrgFAWYc-t",
          "order": null,
          "bounding_box": {
            "x": 0.11017597551644988,
            "y": 0.733451536643026,
            "width": 0.7750573833205815,
            "height": 0.12115839243498817
          },
          "block_content": "The test in Proposition 1 follows the same basic principle as conformal inference (Vovk, Gam- merman, and Shafer, 2005; Chernozhukov, W¨ uthrich, and Zhu, 2018): under the null, the treated observation, after adjustment by the hypothesized treatment effect, should be indistinguishable from the untreated observations. Accordingly, inference is based on the empirical rank of the treated observation among the adjusted sample. Unlike existing conformal methods, however, our procedure requires only uniform consistency of the empirical distribution function. A confidence set for τ can be obtained by inverting the test. In particular, an asymptotic 1 − α confidence set is",
          "label": "Text"
        },
        {
          "id": "qMdm-ec4J8",
          "order": null,
          "bounding_box": {
            "x": 0.11400153022188217,
            "y": 0.8936170212765957,
            "width": 0.315990818668707,
            "height": 0.02009456264775414
          },
          "block_content": "By Proposition~\\ref{prop:conform},\n$\\Pp(\\tau\\in\\mathcal C_{1-\\alpha})\\to1-\\alpha$.",
          "label": "Text"
        },
        {
          "id": "K5GCtPsFjH",
          "order": null,
          "bounding_box": {
            "x": 0.3267023718439173,
            "y": 0.13770685579196218,
            "width": 0.33894414690130054,
            "height": 0.045508274231678435
          },
          "block_content": "\\[\n\\widehat F(u;x)\n=\n\\frac{1}{T}\n\\sum_{t=1}^T\n\\1\\!\\left\\{\n\\left|U_t-\\1\\{t=T\\}x\\right|\\le u\n\\right\\}.\n\\]",
          "label": "Formula"
        },
        {
          "id": "LnP-S-qrjZ",
          "order": null,
          "bounding_box": {
            "x": 0.45524100994644284,
            "y": 0.2080378250591019,
            "width": 0.0933435348125474,
            "height": 0.023049645390070782
          },
          "block_content": "\\[\nH_0:\\tau=x,\n\\]",
          "label": "Formula"
        },
        {
          "id": "mRwagEhHRm",
          "order": null,
          "bounding_box": {
            "x": 0.3909716908951798,
            "y": 0.2375886524822695,
            "width": 0.21346595256312165,
            "height": 0.031914893617021274
          },
          "block_content": "\\sup_{u\\ge0}\n\\left|\n\\widehat F(u;x)-F(u)\n\\right|\n\\xrightarrow{P}\n0.",
          "label": "Formula"
        },
        {
          "id": "YuBHukwEI0",
          "order": null,
          "bounding_box": {
            "x": 0.4039785768936496,
            "y": 0.2966903073286052,
            "width": 0.1874521805661821,
            "height": 0.02186761229314421
          },
          "block_content": "\\[\n\\widehat F(|U_T-x|;x)\\ge 1-\\alpha.\n\\]",
          "label": "Formula"
        },
        {
          "id": "VyoUR17hHn",
          "order": null,
          "bounding_box": {
            "x": 0.35960214231063503,
            "y": 0.3433806146572104,
            "width": 0.27620504973221116,
            "height": 0.030732860520094562
          },
          "block_content": "\\[\n\\Pp\\!\\left(\n\\widehat F(|U_T-x|;x)\\ge1-\\alpha\n\\right)\n\\longrightarrow\n\\alpha.\n\\]",
          "label": "Formula"
        },
        {
          "id": "hcAIOvsJQ-",
          "order": null,
          "bounding_box": {
            "x": 0.42387146136189746,
            "y": 0.4148936170212766,
            "width": 0.1530221882172915,
            "height": 0.018912529550827423
          },
          "block_content": "\\[\n|U_T-x|=|U_T(0)|.\n\\]",
          "label": "Formula"
        },
        {
          "id": "92bNh2nEn_",
          "order": null,
          "bounding_box": {
            "x": 0.44223412394797246,
            "y": 0.45390070921985815,
            "width": 0.11094108645753634,
            "height": 0.02186761229314421
          },
          "block_content": "\\[\nV=|U_T(0)|.\n\\]",
          "label": "Formula"
        },
        {
          "id": "S0DzE1HnJf",
          "order": null,
          "bounding_box": {
            "x": 0.2563121652639633,
            "y": 0.5005910165484634,
            "width": 0.4881407804131599,
            "height": 0.031323877068557916
          },
          "block_content": "\\[\n\\left|\n\\widehat F(|U_T-x|;x)-F(|U_T-x|)\n\\right|\n\\le\n\\sup_{u\\ge0}\n\\left|\n\\widehat F(u;x)-F(u)\n\\right|\n=o_P(1).\n\\]",
          "label": "Formula"
        },
        {
          "id": "wNraKYJPoG",
          "order": null,
          "bounding_box": {
            "x": 0.3726090283091048,
            "y": 0.5472813238770685,
            "width": 0.25554705432287683,
            "height": 0.026595744680851064
          },
          "block_content": "\\[\n\\widehat F(|U_T-x|;x)\n=\nF(V)+o_P(1).\n\\]",
          "label": "Formula"
        },
        {
          "id": "PZ9X3NGVSa",
          "order": null,
          "bounding_box": {
            "x": 0.4269319051262433,
            "y": 0.5975177304964538,
            "width": 0.1545524100994644,
            "height": 0.02186761229314421
          },
          "block_content": "\\[\nF(V)\\sim\\operatorname{Unif}(0,1).\n\\]",
          "label": "Formula"
        },
        {
          "id": "EbXS3OWVY9",
          "order": null,
          "bounding_box": {
            "x": 0.3856159143075746,
            "y": 0.6400709219858156,
            "width": 0.22800306044376434,
            "height": 0.02541371158392435
          },
          "block_content": "\\[\n\\widehat F(|U_T-x|;x)\n\\xrightarrow{d}\n\\operatorname{Unif}(0,1),\n\\]",
          "label": "Formula"
        },
        {
          "id": "SOzqUa--8o",
          "order": null,
          "bounding_box": {
            "x": 0.3657230298393267,
            "y": 0.6778959810874704,
            "width": 0.26778882938026016,
            "height": 0.031323877068557916
          },
          "block_content": "\\[\n\\Pp\\!\\left(\n\\widehat F(|U_T-x|;x)\\ge1-\\alpha\n\\right)\n\\longrightarrow\n\\alpha.\n\\]",
          "label": "Formula"
        },
        {
          "id": "a31W5tI6J-",
          "order": null,
          "bounding_box": {
            "x": 0.328997704667177,
            "y": 0.8581560283687937,
            "width": 0.3389441469013004,
            "height": 0.03664302600472811
          },
          "block_content": "\\[\n\\mathcal C_{1-\\alpha}\n=\n\\left\\{\nx\\in\\mathbb{R}:\n\\widehat F(|U_T-x|;x)<1-\\alpha\n\\right\\}.\n\\]",
          "label": "Formula"
        },
        {
          "id": "UyPaOWdkhW",
          "order": null,
          "bounding_box": {
            "x": 0.4934965570007651,
            "y": 0.9349881796690307,
            "width": 0.014537107880642693,
            "height": 0.014184397163120567
          },
          "block_content": "2",
          "label": "Text"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
